{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AR1i2yA9m6AgxHk4DLHmVE","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is my complete report on the E2E test structure.\n\n---\n\n## E2E Test Structure Overview\n\n### Feature Directories and Contents\n\nThere are 18 feature directories under `/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/`:\n\n**Vue features (9):**\n- `basic/` - counter.vue, live.ex, basic.spec.js\n- `dead-view/` - dead-view-test.vue, controller.ex, dead-view.spec.js\n- `event/` - event_test.vue, live.ex, event.spec.js\n- `event-reply/` - event_reply_test.vue, live.ex, event_reply.spec.js\n- `form/` - form_test.vue, live.ex, form.spec.js\n- `memory-benchmark/` - item-list.vue, live.ex\n- `navigation/` - navigation.vue, live.ex, navigation.spec.js\n- `prop-diff/` - prop-display.vue, live.ex, prop-diff.spec.js\n- `slot/` - slot_test.vue, live.ex, slot.spec.js\n- `stream/` - stream_test.vue, live.ex, stream.spec.js\n- `upload/` - upload-test.vue, live.ex, upload.spec.js\n\n**React features (7):**\n- `react-basic/` - counter.tsx, live.ex, react-basic.spec.js\n- `react-event/` - event_test.tsx, live.ex, react-event.spec.js\n- `react-form/` - react_form_test.tsx, live.ex, react-form.spec.js\n- `react-navigation/` - navigation.tsx, live.ex, react-navigation.spec.js\n- `react-prop-diff/` - prop-display.tsx, live.ex, react-prop-diff.spec.js\n- `react-slot/` - slot_test.tsx, live.ex, react-slot.spec.js\n- `react-stream/` - stream_test.tsx, live.ex, react-stream.spec.js\n\n---\n\n### Test Utilities (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/utils.js`)\n\nThree helper functions:\n- **`syncLV(page)`** -- Waits for LiveView connection (`.phx-connected`), ensures no loading states, and adds a 50ms buffer.\n- **`evalLV(page, code, selector)`** -- Evaluates Elixir code inside the LiveView process via the `sandbox:eval` event. Returns the result.\n- **`randomString(length)`** -- Generates random alphanumeric strings for test isolation.\n\n---\n\n### Router Setup (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/test_helper.exs`)\n\nKey routes in `LiveVite.E2E.Router`:\n\n**Vue routes:**\n- `/test` -> `TestLive`\n- `/prop-diff-test` -> `PropDiffTestLive`\n- `/navigation/:page` and `/navigation/alt/:page` -> `NavigationLive`\n- `/events` -> `EventLive`\n- `/upload/:mode` -> `UploadTestLive`\n- `/streams` -> `StreamLive`\n- `/form-test` -> `FormTestLive`\n- `/event-reply-test` -> `EventReplyTestLive`\n- `/slot-test` -> `SlotTestLive`\n- `/memory-benchmark` -> `MemoryBenchmarkLive`\n\n**React routes:**\n- `/react-test` -> `ReactTestLive`\n- `/react-prop-diff-test` -> `ReactPropDiffTestLive`\n- `/react-navigation/:page` and `/react-navigation/alt/:page` -> `ReactNavigationLive`\n- `/react-events` -> `ReactEventLive`\n- `/react-streams` -> `ReactStreamLive`\n- `/react-slot-test` -> `ReactSlotTestLive`\n- `/react-form-test` -> `ReactFormTestLive`\n\nThe test_helper also defines:\n- `LiveVite.E2E.Hooks` with `on_mount(:default, ...)` that attaches a `sandbox:eval` event handler (used by `evalLV`)\n- The endpoint runs on port 4004 with `check_origin: false`\n- Layout includes `<script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/app.js\">`\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Stream Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/stream.spec.js`):\n- 17 tests total across base tests and \"Limit Operations\" nested describe\n- Tests: renders initial items, add new items, add multiple in sequence, remove individual/multiple items, clear stream, reset stream, complex workflow (add/remove/clear/reset), validates empty name input, debug info display, item order maintenance, item order after reset (including `at: 0` for reversed order)\n- Limit tests: add multiple at start with positive limit, add multiple at end with negative limit, single item with custom positive/negative limits, limit operations with existing items, validates limit input constraints (disabled when empty/zero), limit operations in sequence\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.StreamLive`\n- Uses `stream_configure(:items, dom_id: &\"songs-#{&1.id}\")` and `stream(:items, items)`\n- Component rendered as: `<LiveVite.vue items={@streams.items} v-component=\"stream_test\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Events: `add_item`, `remove_item` (via `stream_delete_by_dom_id`), `clear_stream` (reset: true with empty), `reset_stream` (at: -1, reset: true), `reset_stream_at_0` (at: 0, reset: true), `add_multiple_start` (at: 0, limit: 5), `add_multiple_end` (at: -1, limit: -5), `add_with_positive_limit`, `add_with_negative_limit`\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/stream_test.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveVite()` to get `live.pushEvent()`\n- Props: `items: { id: number, name: string, description: string }[]`\n- Local state: `newItem`, `positiveLimit`, `negativeLimit`\n- Form for adding items, stream control buttons, limit operation controls with number inputs and disabled state\n- Items list with `data-testid` attributes matching `item-${item.id}`, remove buttons with `data-testid=\"remove-${item.id}\"`\n- Empty message, debug info section\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Upload Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/upload.spec.js`):\n- 9 tests in `useLiveUpload` describe\n- Tests: manual upload (auto_upload: false), automatic upload (auto_upload: true), multiple file selection/upload, file cancellation, max_entries limit (3), file size errors (>1MB), unsupported file types, too many files error, drag and drop upload\n- Uses `/upload/manual` and `/upload/auto` routes\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.UploadTestLive`\n- Mount receives `%{\"mode\" => mode}` from URL params\n- `allow_upload(:test_files, accept: ~w(.txt .pdf .jpg .png), max_entries: 3, max_file_size: 1_000_000, auto_upload: mode == \"auto\")`\n- Component: `<LiveVite.vue upload={@uploads.test_files} uploadedFiles={@uploaded_files} v-component=\"upload-test\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Events: `validate`, `cancel-upload`, `save` (consumes uploads)\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/upload-test.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveUpload(() => props.upload, { changeEvent: \"validate\", submitEvent: \"save\" })`\n- Returns: `entries, showFilePicker, addFiles, submit, cancel`\n- Drag and drop zone with `id=\"drop-zone\"`, `phx-drop-target`\n- File list with entry refs, names, sizes, progress, done status\n- Global errors display, uploaded files list\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Navigation Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/navigation.spec.js`):\n- 2 tests in `useLiveNavigation` describe\n- Test 1: Patch query params (`?foo=bar`), navigate to alt route (`/navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux`), navigate back (`/navigation/test1`)\n- Test 2: Direct route access with query params (`/navigation/alt/direct?test=value&count=42`)\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.NavigationLive`\n- `handle_params` parses URI query string into `query_params` assign\n- Component: `<LiveVite.vue params={@params} query_params={@query_params} v-component=\"navigation\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/navigation.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveNavigation()` returning `{ patch, navigate }`\n- `patchQuery()` calls `patch({ foo: \"bar\", timestamp: Date.now().toString() })`\n- `navigateToAlt()` calls `navigate(\"/navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux\")`\n- `navigateBack()` calls `navigate(\"/navigation/test1\")`\n- Displays `JSON.stringify(params)` in `#current-params` and `JSON.stringify(query_params)` in `#current-query`\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Slot Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/slot.spec.js`):\n- 1 test in \"LiveVite Slot Non-ASCII Character Tests\"\n- Tests 5 slot scenarios: Polish characters, Japanese characters, Emoji, Mixed scripts (Russian/Chinese/Arabic), Special Latin characters\n- Locator pattern: `page.locator('[data-pw-label]:has-text(\"Polish\")').locator('..').locator('[data-pw-slot]')`\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.SlotTestLive`\n- Renders 5 `<LiveVite.vue v-component=\"slot_test\" v-socket={@socket} label=\"Test N: Label\">` with non-ASCII inner content\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/slot_test.vue`):\n- Simple: `defineProps<{ label?: string }>()`, renders `<span data-pw-label>` and `<div data-pw-slot><slot /></div>`\n\n---\n\n### Existing React E2E Tests\n\nAll React tests follow the same pattern as their Vue counterparts, with these key differences:\n\n**React Basic** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-basic/`):\n- LiveView uses `<LiveVite.react count={@counter} v-component=\"counter\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Component uses `useLive()` (not `useLiveVite()`) for `live.pushEvent()`\n- Uses React `useState` for local state instead of Vue `ref()`\n- Same spec as Vue basic (route: `/react-test`)\n\n**React Event** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-event/`):\n- Uses `useLiveEventReact<T>(eventName, handler)` instead of Vue's `useLiveEvent()`\n- Route: `/react-events`, LiveView: `ReactEventLive`\n- Same 4 tests as the pattern\n\n**React Navigation** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-navigation/`):\n- Uses `useLiveNavigationReact()` instead of `useLiveNavigation()`\n- Route: `/react-navigation/:page`, navigates to `/react-navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux`\n- Same 2 tests, identical assertions\n\n**React Stream** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-stream/`):\n- Uses `useLive()` for `live.pushEvent()`\n- Route: `/react-streams`, LiveView: `ReactStreamLive`\n- LiveView is essentially identical to Vue's `StreamLive`\n- Same tests as Vue stream EXCEPT: no \"displays debug information correctly\" test (debug section exists but not tested), and the limit operations are included\n- The React component mirrors the Vue component with same `data-testid` attributes\n\n**React Slot** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-slot/`):\n- Uses `<LiveVite.react v-component=\"slot_test\" v-socket={@socket} label=\"Test N: ...\">`\n- Component receives slot as `default` prop: `{ label, default: defaultSlot }`, renders `{defaultSlot ?? null}`\n- Route: `/react-slot-test`, same assertions as Vue slot test\n\n**React Prop-Diff** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-prop-diff/`):\n- Simple `PropDisplay` component renders `JSON.stringify(data, null, 2)` in a `pre` tag\n- Route: `/react-prop-diff-test`, same 16+ tests as Vue prop-diff\n\n**React Form** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-form/`):\n- Uses `useLiveFormReact<T>(serverForm, options)` instead of Vue's `useLiveForm(() => props.form, options)`\n- Key difference: Vue uses `.value` on computed refs (e.g., `form.isValid.value`, `nameField.inputAttrs.value`), React uses direct properties (`form.isValid`, `nameField.inputProps`)\n- Vue uses `v-bind=\"field.inputAttrs.value\"`, React uses `{...field.inputProps}` spread\n- Route: `/react-form-test`, same 14 tests as Vue form\n\n---\n\n### Key Patterns for Creating React Tests\n\n1. **Import pattern:** `import { useLive, useLiveEventReact, useLiveNavigationReact, useLiveFormReact } from \"live_vite\"`\n\n2. **LiveView template difference:** `<LiveVite.react ... />` instead of `<LiveVite.vue ... />`\n\n3. **React hook naming convention:**\n   - `useLive()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveVite()`\n   - `useLiveEventReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveEvent()`\n   - `useLiveNavigationReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveNavigation()`\n   - `useLiveFormReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveForm()`\n\n4. **Slot handling:** React receives slots as the `default` prop (React element, not function). Render directly: `{defaultSlot ?? null}`\n\n5. **Route naming convention:** React routes use `/react-` prefix (e.g., `/react-streams`, `/react-navigation/:page`)\n\n6. **LiveView module naming:** React LiveViews use `React` prefix (e.g., `ReactStreamLive`, `ReactNavigationLive`)\n\n7. **LiveView modules are identical in logic** to their Vue counterparts -- the only difference is the render function using `<LiveVite.react>` instead of `<LiveVite.vue>`.\n\n8. **Missing React test:** There is no `react-upload` feature directory -- upload tests exist only for Vue. There is also no `react-event-reply` directory."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ad191ca (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 112509\ntool_uses: 43\nduration_ms: 112288</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e05a5f27-3808-43b9-9b1f-a81d138cf285","uuid":"2dae5849-dd15-4dc2-b541-be17d6d3890c","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the E2E test structure in /home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/. I need to understand:\n\n1. List all feature directories and their contents\n2. Read the Vue E2E tests for: stream, upload, navigation, and slots features (the .spec.js files)\n3. Read the corresponding LiveView (live.ex) files and Vue components for those features\n4. Read any existing React E2E tests to understand the React test patterns being used\n5. Read the test/e2e/utils.js file for test utilities\n6. Read test/e2e/test_helper.exs for the router setup\n\nReturn ALL file contents in full - I need every detail to create matching React tests.","agentId":"ad191ca","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is my complete report on the E2E test structure.\n\n---\n\n## E2E Test Structure Overview\n\n### Feature Directories and Contents\n\nThere are 18 feature directories under `/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/`:\n\n**Vue features (9):**\n- `basic/` - counter.vue, live.ex, basic.spec.js\n- `dead-view/` - dead-view-test.vue, controller.ex, dead-view.spec.js\n- `event/` - event_test.vue, live.ex, event.spec.js\n- `event-reply/` - event_reply_test.vue, live.ex, event_reply.spec.js\n- `form/` - form_test.vue, live.ex, form.spec.js\n- `memory-benchmark/` - item-list.vue, live.ex\n- `navigation/` - navigation.vue, live.ex, navigation.spec.js\n- `prop-diff/` - prop-display.vue, live.ex, prop-diff.spec.js\n- `slot/` - slot_test.vue, live.ex, slot.spec.js\n- `stream/` - stream_test.vue, live.ex, stream.spec.js\n- `upload/` - upload-test.vue, live.ex, upload.spec.js\n\n**React features (7):**\n- `react-basic/` - counter.tsx, live.ex, react-basic.spec.js\n- `react-event/` - event_test.tsx, live.ex, react-event.spec.js\n- `react-form/` - react_form_test.tsx, live.ex, react-form.spec.js\n- `react-navigation/` - navigation.tsx, live.ex, react-navigation.spec.js\n- `react-prop-diff/` - prop-display.tsx, live.ex, react-prop-diff.spec.js\n- `react-slot/` - slot_test.tsx, live.ex, react-slot.spec.js\n- `react-stream/` - stream_test.tsx, live.ex, react-stream.spec.js\n\n---\n\n### Test Utilities (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/utils.js`)\n\nThree helper functions:\n- **`syncLV(page)`** -- Waits for LiveView connection (`.phx-connected`), ensures no loading states, and adds a 50ms buffer.\n- **`evalLV(page, code, selector)`** -- Evaluates Elixir code inside the LiveView process via the `sandbox:eval` event. Returns the result.\n- **`randomString(length)`** -- Generates random alphanumeric strings for test isolation.\n\n---\n\n### Router Setup (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/test_helper.exs`)\n\nKey routes in `LiveVite.E2E.Router`:\n\n**Vue routes:**\n- `/test` -> `TestLive`\n- `/prop-diff-test` -> `PropDiffTestLive`\n- `/navigation/:page` and `/navigation/alt/:page` -> `NavigationLive`\n- `/events` -> `EventLive`\n- `/upload/:mode` -> `UploadTestLive`\n- `/streams` -> `StreamLive`\n- `/form-test` -> `FormTestLive`\n- `/event-reply-test` -> `EventReplyTestLive`\n- `/slot-test` -> `SlotTestLive`\n- `/memory-benchmark` -> `MemoryBenchmarkLive`\n\n**React routes:**\n- `/react-test` -> `ReactTestLive`\n- `/react-prop-diff-test` -> `ReactPropDiffTestLive`\n- `/react-navigation/:page` and `/react-navigation/alt/:page` -> `ReactNavigationLive`\n- `/react-events` -> `ReactEventLive`\n- `/react-streams` -> `ReactStreamLive`\n- `/react-slot-test` -> `ReactSlotTestLive`\n- `/react-form-test` -> `ReactFormTestLive`\n\nThe test_helper also defines:\n- `LiveVite.E2E.Hooks` with `on_mount(:default, ...)` that attaches a `sandbox:eval` event handler (used by `evalLV`)\n- The endpoint runs on port 4004 with `check_origin: false`\n- Layout includes `<script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/app.js\">`\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Stream Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/stream.spec.js`):\n- 17 tests total across base tests and \"Limit Operations\" nested describe\n- Tests: renders initial items, add new items, add multiple in sequence, remove individual/multiple items, clear stream, reset stream, complex workflow (add/remove/clear/reset), validates empty name input, debug info display, item order maintenance, item order after reset (including `at: 0` for reversed order)\n- Limit tests: add multiple at start with positive limit, add multiple at end with negative limit, single item with custom positive/negative limits, limit operations with existing items, validates limit input constraints (disabled when empty/zero), limit operations in sequence\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.StreamLive`\n- Uses `stream_configure(:items, dom_id: &\"songs-#{&1.id}\")` and `stream(:items, items)`\n- Component rendered as: `<LiveVite.vue items={@streams.items} v-component=\"stream_test\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Events: `add_item`, `remove_item` (via `stream_delete_by_dom_id`), `clear_stream` (reset: true with empty), `reset_stream` (at: -1, reset: true), `reset_stream_at_0` (at: 0, reset: true), `add_multiple_start` (at: 0, limit: 5), `add_multiple_end` (at: -1, limit: -5), `add_with_positive_limit`, `add_with_negative_limit`\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/stream/stream_test.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveVite()` to get `live.pushEvent()`\n- Props: `items: { id: number, name: string, description: string }[]`\n- Local state: `newItem`, `positiveLimit`, `negativeLimit`\n- Form for adding items, stream control buttons, limit operation controls with number inputs and disabled state\n- Items list with `data-testid` attributes matching `item-${item.id}`, remove buttons with `data-testid=\"remove-${item.id}\"`\n- Empty message, debug info section\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Upload Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/upload.spec.js`):\n- 9 tests in `useLiveUpload` describe\n- Tests: manual upload (auto_upload: false), automatic upload (auto_upload: true), multiple file selection/upload, file cancellation, max_entries limit (3), file size errors (>1MB), unsupported file types, too many files error, drag and drop upload\n- Uses `/upload/manual` and `/upload/auto` routes\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.UploadTestLive`\n- Mount receives `%{\"mode\" => mode}` from URL params\n- `allow_upload(:test_files, accept: ~w(.txt .pdf .jpg .png), max_entries: 3, max_file_size: 1_000_000, auto_upload: mode == \"auto\")`\n- Component: `<LiveVite.vue upload={@uploads.test_files} uploadedFiles={@uploaded_files} v-component=\"upload-test\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Events: `validate`, `cancel-upload`, `save` (consumes uploads)\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/upload/upload-test.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveUpload(() => props.upload, { changeEvent: \"validate\", submitEvent: \"save\" })`\n- Returns: `entries, showFilePicker, addFiles, submit, cancel`\n- Drag and drop zone with `id=\"drop-zone\"`, `phx-drop-target`\n- File list with entry refs, names, sizes, progress, done status\n- Global errors display, uploaded files list\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Navigation Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/navigation.spec.js`):\n- 2 tests in `useLiveNavigation` describe\n- Test 1: Patch query params (`?foo=bar`), navigate to alt route (`/navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux`), navigate back (`/navigation/test1`)\n- Test 2: Direct route access with query params (`/navigation/alt/direct?test=value&count=42`)\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.NavigationLive`\n- `handle_params` parses URI query string into `query_params` assign\n- Component: `<LiveVite.vue params={@params} query_params={@query_params} v-component=\"navigation\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/navigation/navigation.vue`):\n- Uses `useLiveNavigation()` returning `{ patch, navigate }`\n- `patchQuery()` calls `patch({ foo: \"bar\", timestamp: Date.now().toString() })`\n- `navigateToAlt()` calls `navigate(\"/navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux\")`\n- `navigateBack()` calls `navigate(\"/navigation/test1\")`\n- Displays `JSON.stringify(params)` in `#current-params` and `JSON.stringify(query_params)` in `#current-query`\n\n---\n\n### Vue E2E Test: Slot Feature\n\n**Spec** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/slot.spec.js`):\n- 1 test in \"LiveVite Slot Non-ASCII Character Tests\"\n- Tests 5 slot scenarios: Polish characters, Japanese characters, Emoji, Mixed scripts (Russian/Chinese/Arabic), Special Latin characters\n- Locator pattern: `page.locator('[data-pw-label]:has-text(\"Polish\")').locator('..').locator('[data-pw-slot]')`\n\n**LiveView** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/live.ex`):\n- Module: `LiveVite.E2E.SlotTestLive`\n- Renders 5 `<LiveVite.vue v-component=\"slot_test\" v-socket={@socket} label=\"Test N: Label\">` with non-ASCII inner content\n\n**Vue Component** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/slot/slot_test.vue`):\n- Simple: `defineProps<{ label?: string }>()`, renders `<span data-pw-label>` and `<div data-pw-slot><slot /></div>`\n\n---\n\n### Existing React E2E Tests\n\nAll React tests follow the same pattern as their Vue counterparts, with these key differences:\n\n**React Basic** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-basic/`):\n- LiveView uses `<LiveVite.react count={@counter} v-component=\"counter\" v-socket={@socket} />`\n- Component uses `useLive()` (not `useLiveVite()`) for `live.pushEvent()`\n- Uses React `useState` for local state instead of Vue `ref()`\n- Same spec as Vue basic (route: `/react-test`)\n\n**React Event** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-event/`):\n- Uses `useLiveEventReact<T>(eventName, handler)` instead of Vue's `useLiveEvent()`\n- Route: `/react-events`, LiveView: `ReactEventLive`\n- Same 4 tests as the pattern\n\n**React Navigation** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-navigation/`):\n- Uses `useLiveNavigationReact()` instead of `useLiveNavigation()`\n- Route: `/react-navigation/:page`, navigates to `/react-navigation/alt/test2?baz=qux`\n- Same 2 tests, identical assertions\n\n**React Stream** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-stream/`):\n- Uses `useLive()` for `live.pushEvent()`\n- Route: `/react-streams`, LiveView: `ReactStreamLive`\n- LiveView is essentially identical to Vue's `StreamLive`\n- Same tests as Vue stream EXCEPT: no \"displays debug information correctly\" test (debug section exists but not tested), and the limit operations are included\n- The React component mirrors the Vue component with same `data-testid` attributes\n\n**React Slot** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-slot/`):\n- Uses `<LiveVite.react v-component=\"slot_test\" v-socket={@socket} label=\"Test N: ...\">`\n- Component receives slot as `default` prop: `{ label, default: defaultSlot }`, renders `{defaultSlot ?? null}`\n- Route: `/react-slot-test`, same assertions as Vue slot test\n\n**React Prop-Diff** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-prop-diff/`):\n- Simple `PropDisplay` component renders `JSON.stringify(data, null, 2)` in a `pre` tag\n- Route: `/react-prop-diff-test`, same 16+ tests as Vue prop-diff\n\n**React Form** (`/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/test/e2e/features/react-form/`):\n- Uses `useLiveFormReact<T>(serverForm, options)` instead of Vue's `useLiveForm(() => props.form, options)`\n- Key difference: Vue uses `.value` on computed refs (e.g., `form.isValid.value`, `nameField.inputAttrs.value`), React uses direct properties (`form.isValid`, `nameField.inputProps`)\n- Vue uses `v-bind=\"field.inputAttrs.value\"`, React uses `{...field.inputProps}` spread\n- Route: `/react-form-test`, same 14 tests as Vue form\n\n---\n\n### Key Patterns for Creating React Tests\n\n1. **Import pattern:** `import { useLive, useLiveEventReact, useLiveNavigationReact, useLiveFormReact } from \"live_vite\"`\n\n2. **LiveView template difference:** `<LiveVite.react ... />` instead of `<LiveVite.vue ... />`\n\n3. **React hook naming convention:**\n   - `useLive()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveVite()`\n   - `useLiveEventReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveEvent()`\n   - `useLiveNavigationReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveNavigation()`\n   - `useLiveFormReact()` = React's equivalent of `useLiveForm()`\n\n4. **Slot handling:** React receives slots as the `default` prop (React element, not function). Render directly: `{defaultSlot ?? null}`\n\n5. **Route naming convention:** React routes use `/react-` prefix (e.g., `/react-streams`, `/react-navigation/:page`)\n\n6. **LiveView module naming:** React LiveViews use `React` prefix (e.g., `ReactStreamLive`, `ReactNavigationLive`)\n\n7. **LiveView modules are identical in logic** to their Vue counterparts -- the only difference is the render function using `<LiveVite.react>` instead of `<LiveVite.vue>`.\n\n8. **Missing React test:** There is no `react-upload` feature directory -- upload tests exist only for Vue. There is also no `react-event-reply` directory."}],"totalDurationMs":112288,"totalTokens":112509,"totalToolUseCount":43,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19376,"cache_read_input_tokens":89028,"output_tokens":4104,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19376,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0}}}}
