{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FPhgHvgLmq6pvw19z9T8EZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I can see the issue clearly:\n1. `data-phx-active-refs` is empty (`\"\"`) even though there's 1 file selected\n2. `files` is `0` on the input element\n\nThe problem is that `data-phx-active-refs` should contain the entry refs, but the React hook's `useEffect` for updating entry refs isn't firing correctly. Also the `files` property is 0 - meaning the files aren't set on the hidden input.\n\nLooking at the React hook flow:\n1. When `setInputFiles` is called by Playwright, it sets files on the original `<input type=\"file\">` that Playwright can find\n2. But wait - Playwright needs to find the actual input. The React hook creates a hidden form with an input. Playwright's `setInputFiles` targets `input[type=\"file\"]` which finds this hidden input.\n3. When Playwright sets files, it triggers a `change` event which Phoenix intercepts through `Phoenix.LiveFileUpload` hook.\n4. Then Phoenix sends a `validate` event to the server, and the server updates the upload config with entries.\n5. The React hook's `useEffect` should then update the `data-phx-active-refs`.\n\nBut `files` is 0 after `syncLV` - this means either:\n- Playwright sets the files, the change event triggers Phoenix upload, and Phoenix resets the input's files (this is normal - Phoenix stores files internally)\n- OR the files never got set correctly\n\nThe real issue is `data-phx-active-refs` is empty. This means the entries aren't being reflected in the DOM attribute. Let me check the React hook's useEffect."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":600,"cache_read_input_tokens":105016,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":600},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e05a5f27-3808-43b9-9b1f-a81d138cf285","uuid":"26fcb93e-4244-4cc3-83f0-ca81a0c443b7"}
