{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ah23AYV3QVLWCGWZaabbe8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The auto-upload test needs to be adapted. With the React hook, auto-upload doesn't trigger automatically because the active refs aren't set in time. But after the refs are set (via useEffect), we can re-trigger the change event to let Phoenix know the refs are ready. Let me instead update the auto-upload test to verify the auto-upload behavior differently - checking that files get selected and that the auto_upload flag is correctly reflected, then manually re-trigger the upload.\n\nActually, I think a better approach is to add a small workaround in the React upload hook to handle auto-upload - after setting refs in useEffect, if auto_upload is true and there are active non-preflighted entries, re-dispatch the change event to trigger Phoenix's auto-upload mechanism."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":904,"cache_read_input_tokens":132222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":904},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e05a5f27-3808-43b9-9b1f-a81d138cf285","uuid":"e27ba22c-48d3-46f2-a8b7-6e9646ec03ab"}
